{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1002_p", "source_sha256": "21d0f4c268af36f7207cf7ba3881f9510403819a82eed6bb91434d8f6c4e2afb", "ja": "お疲れさま、響。\nどうだ？　衣装の着心地は。問題なさそうか？", "zh": "辛苦了，响。\n那件服装穿起来如何？没什么问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "53c504d20a1bfc84c83de0be904f35173543952cef9f5fb8e864a2a1fd9044b6", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\nうん、自分、すっごく気に入ったぞ！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n嗯，本人非常中意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "f7b7dcb000b4765344b0b930b5dddb77652bf3f2d0518801c183817495a5cb6d", "ja": "えへへっ、見て見て！　すっごくかわいいでしょ？\nこの衣装なら、オオカミ役もカンペキさー！", "zh": "嘿嘿，你看你看！非常可爱对吧？\n只要穿上它，大野狼角色也能完美演出啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1005_p", "source_sha256": "63ee47a40bbd15b8716e0864c29dbc58e221e2fc3e8357121c67dbaa5137210a", "ja": "ああ、確かに可愛い衣装だな。\n演技の方は、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "是啊，的确是很可爱的服装呢。\n演技方面没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "14a65e23f6b1e34d78bcc5e24c02c1895f04ce0c01f2eb3eaa05a985399e9cf5", "ja": "もちろん、バッチリだぞ！\n動物のことなら、自分にまかせてよ！", "zh": "当然是万无一失喔！\n只要是跟动物有关的事，就交给本人吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "013de0a35e56dbfca3bb0dca630ba729909a4f9dca905e857dec8f0dd3629dce", "ja": "早く撮影が始まらないかな～。\n自分、みんなにビッキーを見せてあげたいんだ！", "zh": "真希望早点开始拍摄呢～\n本人好想让大家看看毕奇的模样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1008_p", "source_sha256": "87c7d0550a9e3f71d3825a37ddbf01ef8e1021e7f422fef463b19d7b469d4b12", "ja": "響は本当に、ビッキーの事が好きなんだな。\nブログにも書いてたし……。", "zh": "你真的很喜欢毕奇呢，\n就连部落格上也有写到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "ace91b20609e57581f27f0d4c14e5469033ee7bb72d448310f878b2fd73da6a9", "ja": "うん！　だってビッキーって、オオカミだけど\nすごく優しくて、いいやつなんだ！", "zh": "嗯！因为牠虽然是大野狼，\n却十分温柔，是个好家伙呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "79628965b00a0b994888c53c5fd86e5fd05d44da787be0bd9273e6fbd79e0ce0", "ja": "ビッキーって、最初、人間を怖がってるでしょ？\nそれって、人間にイジワルされたからなんだけど……。", "zh": "毕奇一开始不是会害怕人类吗？\n那是因为牠曾被人类欺负过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "4b0bcbd5da0e2fcc0cf9709923bcb48b9706aec4cfb3138d27d710789d5cbd64", "ja": "それでも友達がほしいって言うビッキーは、\nすごく勇気があるって、自分は思ったんだ！", "zh": "即使如此毕奇还是勇于说出想要交到朋友，\n本人认为牠实在非常有勇气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1012_p", "source_sha256": "67612d6c89c36c7b6c63365844fe1a9541546c5bff470a25c10b322bd921f5dc", "ja": "そうだな。怖くても踏み出すのは、\nビッキーに勇気があるからだろうな。", "zh": "是啊，牠即使害怕依然向前迈进，\n原因就在于牠很有勇气吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "588aea83410cec9817cc2b0eccc56461be3e7b600a09d81e5e3fc257b4d7751e", "ja": "うん。だから、みんなに見せたいんだ。ひとりぼっちが\n寂しいって気持ちは、みんなにもわかるでしょ？", "zh": "嗯，所以本人才会想要让大家看看。\n大家应该也明白孤孤单单会很寂寞的心情吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "e1f736aa4d2db2b3f9d448ebbb989c0215b9074ab0045966de1bb7f2ee53c455", "ja": "何かしたいことがあるけど、怖くて\n勇気が出せない人って、いっぱいいると思うんだ。", "zh": "尽管有什么想做的事，却因为害怕而无法鼓起勇气，\n本人认为这种人一定非常多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "13fc8d42d31c11b8bfacc45801adc20334d0b9b9039024387c4f7a1fc230fdbc", "ja": "だからこの映画で、そんなみんなに勇気を\nわけてあげられたらいいなって……自分、そう思うぞ！", "zh": "所以要是能借由这部电影，\n把勇气分给那些人就太好了……本人是这么想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e764745dafcc5ca3143ab87e96d5af8ecdd2e304497c0895c469c38a9d421a9e", "ja": "ああ、響ならきっとできると思う。\n俺もサポートするから、一緒に頑張っていこう！", "zh": "嗯，我认为如果是你一定办得到。\n我也会支援你的，我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "851c9094c06eb26180c57e294ac0ab2fd59e0ad82044a6181dda39c768b100f5", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}！\nそう言ってくれると、自分、勇気がでるぞ！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n听到你这么说，本人就有勇气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "91b6eecd91b96108edeb654a196710ace8f8cff91b658697a7cfc6e76aa0ff9f", "ja": "撮影でもカンペキに決めてみせるから、\nビッキーと自分のこと、最後まで応援しててよねっ！", "zh": "拍摄时本人也会完美诠释的，\n你要为毕奇和本人加油打气到最后喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0134_1019_p", "source_sha256": "838623adabe776f21efa10e71ea8ae2b8b256c816e652039ebe1458222e1f5c8", "ja": "（撮影開始に向けて、響のやる気は十分……\n始まるのが、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（电影拍摄在即，响显得干劲十足……\n真期待正式开拍的到来呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
